1
00:00:01,110 --> 00:00:02,000
Stop!

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,250
Never read this SMS code to a stranger who says «You won».

3
00:00:06,820 --> 00:00:08,300
Wow! I won an iPhone!

4
00:00:08,950 --> 00:00:10,770
I only have five minutes.

5
00:00:12,210 --> 00:00:14,600
Hello, I'm calling from the bank.

6
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:15,800
You've received a code.

7
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:18,060
Just tell it to me and we'll process your gift.

8
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:20,800
One moment, one moment...

9
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,710
Before you say the code, read the SMS out loud to me.

10
00:00:27,190 --> 00:00:28,900
Telegram code...

11
00:00:30,590 --> 00:00:32,700
«Do not give this code to anyone»...

12
00:00:34,360 --> 00:00:35,900
This isn't a gift code.

13
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:37,920
It's the key to your Telegram.

14
00:00:38,540 --> 00:00:41,450
Give away the key, and you open the door yourself.

15
00:00:43,060 --> 00:00:44,880
They don't give gifts.

16
00:00:45,350 --> 00:00:49,040
They ask your loved ones for money in your name.

17
00:00:50,730 --> 00:00:51,600
Three signs.

18
00:00:52,470 --> 00:00:54,050
You didn't enter any contest.

19
00:00:54,940 --> 00:00:56,000
They're rushing you.

20
00:00:56,930 --> 00:00:57,870
They're asking for a code.

21
00:00:58,870 --> 00:01:00,970
All three? It's a trap.

22
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:03,400
Hang up.

23
00:01:03,820 --> 00:01:06,420
Call the bank yourself on its official number.

24
00:01:06,800 --> 00:01:08,840
Turn on Telegram's cloud password:

25
00:01:09,290 --> 00:01:11,230
even if they get the code, they can't log in.

26
00:01:12,850 --> 00:01:14,700
Five minutes are over.

27
00:01:15,350 --> 00:01:16,740
And I lost nothing.

28
00:01:17,350 --> 00:01:22,650
A real gift never asks you for a code.

29
00:01:24,040 --> 00:01:25,160
Got a suspicious message?

30
00:01:25,480 --> 00:01:28,730
Send a screenshot to our bot: @sahiychishopbot

31
00:01:28,930 --> 00:01:31,600
It tells you if it's a scam,

32
00:01:31,600 --> 00:01:34,390
and teaches you step by step to turn on the cloud password.

